# UI-Komponenten (React + Tailwind v4)

- **Paradigma:** Funktionale Komponenten + Hooks. Vite-SPA — Lazy-Loading wie in `App.tsx`; kein Next.js RSC-Split.
- **Props:** Klare TS-Typen; booleans benannt (`isOpen`, `disabled`); `children` nur bei echter Komposition.
- **Tailwind v4:** Utility-First via `@theme` tokens in `src/index.css` (no `tailwind.config.js`); Cybernetic/Glass patterns from the design system; inline styles only for dynamic values.
- **A11y:** Fokus, `aria-*`, Tastatur (inkl. Cmd+K); jsx-a11y ernst nehmen — keine blinden `eslint-disable`.
- **i18n:** Sichtbare Strings nur über `t()` / `translations.ts`, EN+DE-Paarität.
- **Motion:** Framer Motion sparsam; Layout-Thrashing vermeiden.

<example>
Use `bg-surface text-text-primary border-border` backed by `@theme` tokens in `src/index.css`; render user-facing copy via `t()`; keep focus rings and keyboard access on interactive controls.
</example>

<example type="invalid">
Add reusable tokens to a revived `tailwind.config.js`, hardcode repeated hex colors in a component, or ship a new button label as a raw English string without an EN+DE `translations.ts` key.
</example>

See `@src/App.tsx`, `@src/i18n/translations.ts`, `@src/components/ui/`, `@src/index.css`.
